          "comment": "# Comfy MAI Image 2.6- Image Edit\n\nEdit images with MAI Image 2.6, Microsoft's flagship model for image editing, combining two reference images into a single refined output. Ideal for multi-reference compositing, product visual restyling, and text-in-image design work. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_openrouter_mai_image_26_image_edit.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
